@baseUrl = http://localhost:4000/api

### ===================================================
### 0. AUTENTICACIÓN: REGISTRO Y LOGIN
### ===================================================

### Registro de Administrador
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/registro
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombre": "Jorge Administrador",
  "email": "admin@lecturaabierta.com",
  "password": "Password123*",
  "rol": "ADMIN"
}

### Registro de Lector Estándar
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/registro
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombre": "Carlos Lector",
  "email": "lector@lecturaabierta.com",
  "password": "Password123*",
  "rol": "LECTOR"
}

### Login Admin -> Devuelve accessToken y refreshToken
# @name loginAdmin
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@lecturaabierta.com",
  "password": "Password123*"
}

### Login Lector
# @name loginLector
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "lector@lecturaabierta.com",
  "password": "Password123*"
}

@adminToken = {{loginAdmin.response.body.accessToken}}
@adminRefreshToken = {{loginAdmin.response.body.refreshToken}}
@lectorToken = {{loginLector.response.body.accessToken}}

### ===================================================
### 1. NIVEL 1: SIN AUTENTICACIÓN
### ===================================================

### [EXITOSA] Lectores Público (200 OK)
GET {{baseUrl}}/lectores/publico

### [EXITOSA] Préstamos Estadísticas Públicas (200 OK)
GET {{baseUrl}}/prestamos/estadisticas-publicas

### ===================================================
### 2. NIVEL 2: SOLO AUTENTICACIÓN (x-api-key)
### ===================================================

### [FALSA / ERROR] Sin cabecera x-api-key (401 Unauthorized)
GET {{baseUrl}}/lectores/autenticado-basico

### [EXITOSA] Con cabecera x-api-key correcta (200 OK)
GET {{baseUrl}}/lectores/autenticado-basico
x-api-key: lectura-abierta-basic-key

### [FALSA / ERROR] Préstamos resumen sin cabecera (401 Unauthorized)
GET {{baseUrl}}/prestamos/resumen-interno

### [EXITOSA] Préstamos resumen con cabecera correcta (200 OK)
GET {{baseUrl}}/prestamos/resumen-interno
x-api-key: lectura-abierta-basic-key

### ===================================================
### 3. NIVEL 3: JWT TOKEN + REFRESH TOKEN
### ===================================================

### [FALSA / ERROR] Consulta sin token Bearer (401 Unauthorized)
GET {{baseUrl}}/prestamos

### [EXITOSA] Consulta con JWT Bearer válido (200 OK)
GET {{baseUrl}}/prestamos
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### [EXITOSA] Consulta lectores con JWT Bearer válido (200 OK)
GET {{baseUrl}}/lectores/jwt
Authorization: Bearer {{lectorToken}}

### [EXITOSA] Refrescar Access Token usando Refresh Token (200 OK)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "{{adminRefreshToken}}"
}

### [FALSA / ERROR] Refrescar con Refresh Token inválido o corrupto (403 Forbidden)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "token-invalido-123"
}

### ===================================================
### 4. NIVEL 4: JWT + REFRESH + RBAC
### ===================================================

### [FALSA / ERROR] Usuario con rol LECTOR intentando crear recurso restringido a ADMIN (403 Forbidden)
POST {{baseUrl}}/lectores
Authorization: Bearer {{lectorToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombre": "Intento Denegado",
  "email": "denegado@test.com",
  "documento": "999999"
}

### [EXITOSA] Usuario con rol ADMIN creando recurso con éxito (201 Created)
POST {{baseUrl}}/lectores
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombre": "Lector Autorizado",
  "email": "autorizado@test.com",
  "documento": "12345678"
}
